declineReason.description:
Filled, if the transaction was declined. The decline reason `type`, together with `title` and `description` in all supported languages. E.g.:
```
{
  "type": "LOCKED_CARD",
  "title": {
    "en": "Card locked"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "The card is locked. You can unlock the card in the Wallet section of the cardholder app."
  }
}
```
If the transaction status is anything else but `DECLINED` the object `declineReason` returns `null`
